OL,3,GNEWSAStart date for year-long A38
OL,4,Abridge works
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaintenance work on a bridge over the
OL,7,FA38 in South Derbyshire is set to begin
OL,8,Fnext month, with a number of traffic
OL,9,Frestrictions to last more than a year.
OL,11,FNational Highways said it plans to
OL,12,Fcarry out work on the A5132 Carriers
OL,13,FRoad over the A38 in Willington, which
OL,14,Fincludes concrete repairs,
OL,15,Fre-waterproofing, replacement of bridge
OL,16,Fjoints, resurfacing and safety barrier
OL,17,Frenewal.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
