OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1787468167
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAStart date for year-long A38
OL,4,Abridge works
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighways bosses said it forms a larger
OL,7,Fprogramme of work, adding that many of
OL,8,Fthe bridges were built more than 50
OL,9,Fyears ago and now need renewing or
OL,10,Freplacing.
OL,12,FNational Highways project manager,
OL,13,FMatthew Palmer, said the work is
OL,14,F"essential to repair, protect and
OL,15,Ffuture-proof" the bridge.
